#: ../../usage.rst:309
msgid "Paper figures"
msgstr "Figuras do artigo"

#: ../../usage.rst:311
msgid ""
"Renders the SIMAC and JCIS figures at their final printed size (so the "
"requested point sizes are the point sizes on the page):"
msgstr ""
"Gera as figuras do SIMAC e do JCIS no tamanho final de impressão (de modo"
" que os tamanhos de ponto solicitados sejam os tamanhos na página):"

#: ../../usage.rst:318
msgid ""
"Emits PDF and SVG under ``paper-figures/simac/`` and ``paper-"
"figures/jcis/``. Restrict to one manuscript or customise the "
"locations/formats with the flags:"
msgstr ""
"Emite PDF e SVG em ``paper-figures/simac/`` e ``paper-figures/jcis/``. "
