msgstr ""
"A flag é suportada por ``attractors``, ``sensitivity``, ``comm-ideal``, "
"``comm-fir``, ``comm-order-n``, ``sweep plot``, ``analysis plot-chaotic-"
"map``, ``analysis plot-chaotic-density``, ``analysis export-tables`` e "
